  <!-- EN: kingdom -->
  <RK_Culture_Virtuard.label>王国</RK_Culture_Virtuard.label>
  <!-- EN: A chivalrous feudal kingdom culture of the Ratkin, where honor and nobility are held in high regard. While their technology remains medieval, they have access to some ultratech equipment through trade and ancient relics. -->
  <RK_Culture_Virtuard.description>鼠族崇尚荣耀与高贵的骑士精神封建王国文化。尽管总体科技水平仍属于中世纪级别，但通过贸易和研究远古圣物，他们也得以获取并使用部分极致科技级别的装备。</RK_Culture_Virtuard.description>
  
